# RewardGen SOLE inference entries. Training and unrelated model/API utilities
# from the upstream all-in-one projects remain excluded. Agentlace is installed
# separately with --no-deps from locks/sole-r1-client-no-deps.txt to avoid
# duplicate cv2 distributions.
